    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk sugar, salt, paprika, turmeric, onion powder, and garlic powder together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread cauliflower onto the prepared baking sheet; spray liberally with cooking spray. Season cauliflower with spice mixture.",
